    "Deleted %@." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What VoiceOver says once the view is deleted. Placeholders in order: name.\nWhat VoiceOver says once Delete Feed deleted a feed. %@ is a list of what went: the feed, its downloads, and what it kept for removed downloads."
    },
    "Deleted %@. %@ selected, %lld of %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What VoiceOver says once a view is deleted, naming the view selected now and its place (finding 13): \"Deleted Mine. Feeds selected, 6 of 6.\". Placeholders in order: name, selected, number, count.",
      "localizations" : {
