    "Discard" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the audio editor's close question that undoes the unsaved edits.\nTitle of the button that deletes a recording, in the Record window's list of recordings left behind and in the question asked when it closes.\nTitle of the question's button that deletes the recording, when the Record window is closed."
