    "Edit" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the track question that opens the audio editor on the track chosen, and the heading of the audio editor's editing buttons.\nName of a filter preset's Edit button, also its VoiceOver action and context menu item.\nName of the command that opens a substitution rule's editor: a row button's label and tooltip, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item.\nTitle of the toolbar button that enters edit mode in the Library list, for selecting several books."
    },
    "Edit %@" : {
