    "Episodes" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the count of a feed's episodes in Feed Info. Title case.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A kind of row as its checkbox names it: \"Books\", \"Episodes\", \"Articles\", or \"Feeds\". This is the case .episodes."
    },
