          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found a recording from before TextMouth last quit, under %@. Save or discard it." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement of the Record window when it finds one recording left behind. %@ is the heading of the list of recovered recordings."
    },
    "Found at %@. When on, the editor's filters run through ffmpeg, with every filter it has." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the Use ffmpeg for filters switch in Storage settings. %@ is the folder path where the ffmpeg program was found. ffmpeg is the program's name."
    },
    "Free up space, then import it again." : {
