    "It holds the feed “%@” with %@; the record holds %@." : {
      "comment" : "What a conflicting copy of a feed's record holds, set against the record itself. %1$@ is the feed's title; %2$@ and %3$@ are counts of items, such as \"12 items\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
