    "Leaves the original file where it is." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Keep button of the question about the original file."
    },
    "Left %@ where it is: episodes and articles stay in their feeds; %@ makes one a book of your library." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when Move to Folder left one feed item where it is. %1$@ is the item's title, in quotes. %2$@ is the name of the Move to Library command, which makes an item a book of the library.",
      "localizations" : {
