    "Move Down" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item and VoiceOver action of a book's row that moves the book one place toward the bottom of an order the user arranges.\nName of a filter preset's Move Down button, also its VoiceOver action and context menu item.\nName of the command that moves a substitution rule down the list: a row button's label and tooltip, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The command that moves a view one place down."
