    "Not in a folder" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What a book's summary says of a book in no folder."
    },
    "Not in the Reading List" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A condition's relation as its relation pop-up names it, by its test and whether it is negated. This is the form for the first case of the condition."
    },
    "Not in the book's audio yet. Discard undoes them; next time you edit this book, Redo brings them back until you make another edit." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the question asked as the audio editor's window with unsaved edits closes: what Discard does."
    },
    "Not kept" : {
      "comment" : "The original audio's state in the audio editor's Audio Info sheet: it is not kept."
    },
    "Not known until the book is downloaded" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. The pop-up's value for a book that records no encoding and whose file is only in the cloud, which is never downloaded to learn it."
    },
    "Not known, since the file can't be read" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. The pop-up's value for a book that records no encoding and whose file cannot be read."
