    "The transcript, with its text as Markdown for an audiobook." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Transcript checkbox in the Export dialog."
    },
    "The transcript, with your changes, stays with the episode in its feed, even after its download is deleted. Deleting the episode or feed deletes it; Move to Library keeps it as a book." : {
      "comment" : "Note under a podcast episode's transcript editor and cleanup sheet. Move to Library is the name of a command in the feed's episode menu."
    },
    "The unreadable library index is no longer there, so TextMouth saved the library rebuilt from your books as the new index, with %@." : {
      "comment" : "Outcome of the library index recovery when the unreadable index had gone and the rebuilt library was saved as the new index. %@ is a count of books, such as \"743 books\"."
    },
    "The view is first in the list." : {
